    "detailed_description": "<strong>Young Detectives</strong><br>Dive into a world of colorful discovery with &quot;Young Detectives,&quot; the ultimate spot the difference game for young minds!<br><br>Your mission: to identify the subtle distinctions between seemingly identical scenes.<br>Explore 30 vibrant and intricately designed 2D levels, each brimming with challenging differences to find.<br>Set in a playful environment, players step into the shoes of a keen eyed detective.<br>Can't spot the difference? No problem! Our handy hint button is always ready to assist, guiding you to the next elusive change.<br><br><i>Key Features:</i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>30 Diverse Levels, each level offers a unique challenge.<br></li><li>Stuck? Use Hints: Use hints to reveal the next difference and keep the fun going.<br></li><li>Multilingual Support: Play in your preferred language, with support for 27 different languages.<br></li><li>Steam Achievements: Unlock a range of achievements as you master each level and sharpen your detective skills.</li></ul><br>Perfect for players of all ages, &quot;Young Detectives&quot; combines engaging gameplay with educational fun. Are you ready to become the ultimate detective?",
